== 3. the packet stream's rarest kind ==
kind 2 drawn with probability 0.1 per packet: P(none in 64) = 0.9^64 = 0.00118
packets for a 99% chance of at least one kind 2: 44
== 4. a per-cycle rate is not a per-seed rate ==
a bin hit in 1.13% of cycles: independent 200-cycle seeds would
hit it with probability 1 - (1 - 0.0113)^200 = 0.897
checks: 10 of 10 hold
verdict: chain gives 0.2421 for 200 even cycles, 8.45e-05 for 30
